RipDisk 1.0.1
================

Copyright (C) 2026 RipDisk contributors

RipDisk is a macOS ARM64 port derived from Asunder 3.0.1. The application
source is distributed under GNU GPL version 2 only. See COPYING for the full
licence and warranty disclaimer, and AUTHORS for the original Asunder credits.

The SwiftUI port and macOS integration were created in 2026. Files carrying an
SPDX-License-Identifier identify their applicable licence. The original Asunder
icon by Radu Potop is retained and credited in AUTHORS.

RipDisk invokes separately distributed command-line programs for CD audio
extraction and encoding. Those programs are aggregated in the application
bundle for portability and retain their own copyrights and licences. See
Resources/ThirdPartyTools.txt, THIRD_PARTY_SOURCES.md, and
Resources/ThirdPartyLicenses/.

